    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26589" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεξ-ᾰγωγή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>settlement</i> of a dispute,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.102.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>inquiry, inquest,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				14.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				65.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>trial,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ποιήσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					5040.59
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Crete</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τοῦ βίου</span>”
				<i>a way of living,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					4.30
				</span></i>
			, cf. Hierocl.<i><span class="en">
				p.53A.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.158
			</span></i>, al.: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sto.</u>
				339.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				1.6.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ecphant.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.7.64
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς δ. ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					1.178
				</span></i>
			.</div>
